 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                              MASTER SERVICES\n1200 Industrial Parkway, 62701 Springfield, United States         AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US48-7573884\nReg No: US-921570                                                  PAID [circled]\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\n\nNorthwind Trading Inc                                             Summit Medical Devices Inc\n1200 Industrial Parkway                                           450 Madison Avenue\n62701 Springfield                                                 80201 Denver\nUnited States                                                     United States\nVAT: US48-7573884\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 02/17/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Northwind\nTrading Inc, with its registered office at 1200 Industrial Parkway, Springfield (\"Party A\"), and Summit Medical Devices Inc, with its\nregistered office at 450 Madison Avenue, Denver (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Northwind Trading Inc / David Kim\nParty B    Summit Medical Devices Inc / John Carter\nDate       02/17/2026",
